{"id":"80418eede5544150","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-prefix-projection.md","title":"Prefix Projection","display":"df-prefix-projection — Prefix Projection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-prefix-projection","aliases":["90-df-prefix-projection","90-df-prefix"],"display":"df-prefix-projection — Prefix Projection","depends_on":["[[90-df-sequence]]","[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","[[90-df-iota-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-prefix-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-prefix-projection</span><span>90-df-prefix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prefix-projection — Prefix Projection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d54f327008e148ac\" href=\"?note=d54f327008e148ac\" title=\"90-df-iota-operator\">90-df-iota-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_j\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_j\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a>，编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 直接引用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d54f327008e148ac\" href=\"?note=d54f327008e148ac\" title=\"90-df-iota-operator\">90-df-iota-operator</a>，下述公式的全部自由参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,i\">\\(s,i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP(s,i,t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Seq}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Len}(t)=\\min(i,\\operatorname{Len}(s))\\land\n\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t)\\ (t)_j=(s)_j,\\\\\n\\forall s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(s,i,t),\\\\\n\\pi_{\\le i}(s)&amp;:=\\iota t\\,(t\\in\\mathbb N\\land P(s,i,t)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP(s,i,t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Seq}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Len}(t)=\\min(i,\\operatorname{Len}(s))\\land\n\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(t)\\ (t)_j=(s)_j,\\\\\n\\forall s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(s,i,t),\\\\\n\\pi_{\\le i}(s)&amp;:=\\iota t\\,(t\\in\\mathbb N\\land P(s,i,t)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在见证是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle(s)_0,\\ldots,(s)_{\\min(i,\\operatorname{Len}(s))-1}\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle(s)_0,\\ldots,(s)_{\\min(i,\\operatorname{Len}(s))-1}\\rangle)\\)</span>，唯一性由编码单射性给出。保留原接口含义：返回前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 项，而不是下标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1\">\\(i+1\\)</span> 项；该接口仍只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\)</span> 的原定义域上使用，不为非法输入另定返回值。此描述引入的是有唯一图的元理论函数缩写。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d54f327008e148ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-iota-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,i\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{Seq}(s)$；$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_j$ 见 [[90-df-sequence]]，编码见 [[90-df-sequence-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,i\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{Seq}(s)$；$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_j$ 见 [[90-df-sequence]]，编码见 [[90-df-sequence-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d54f327008e148ac","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\iota$ 直接引用 [[90-df-iota-operator]]，下述公式的全部自由参数为 $s,i$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"s,i","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP(s,i,t)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Seq}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Len}(t)=\\min(i,\\operatorname{Len}(s))\\land\n\\forall j<\\operatorname{Len}(t)\\ (t)_j=(s)_j,\\\\\n\\forall s,i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(s,i,t),\\\\\n\\pi_{\\le i}(s)&:=\\iota t\\,(t\\in\\mathbb N\\land P(s,i,t)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle(s)_0,\\ldots,(s)_{\\min(i,\\operatorname{Len}(s))-1}\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"i+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)","display":false}],"bytes":1435,"backlinks":[{"id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\pi_{\\le i}(s)$ 与 $s\\frown m$ 只在 $\\operatorname{Seq}(s)$ 上取 [[90-df-prefix-projection]]、[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]] 的原接口。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-prefix-projection]]、[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-d